{"id":4635,"date":"2016-06-13T14:02:38","date_gmt":"2016-06-13T14:02:38","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.myjammindjs.com\/?page_id=4635"},"modified":"2026-06-04T17:36:59","modified_gmt":"2026-06-04T17:36:59","slug":"atlanta-wedding-uplighting","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/atlanta-wedding-uplighting\/","title":{"rendered":"Atlanta Wedding Uplighting &#038; Event Lighting"},"content":{"rendered":"\r\n<h1>\r\n\t\tWedding DecorUp-lighting\r\n\t<\/h1>\r\n\t<p>We understand that your wedding and reception is one of the most important days of your life, and JAMMIN&#8217; DJs takes the time to understand your vision!\u00a0 One way to make this happen is with decor \/ up-lighting for your event!\u00a0 This is an affordable way to transform a room to the vision you want!<\/p>\r\n<p>What separates\u00a0JAMMIN&#8217; DJs from other entertainment or lighting companies is we use state of the art technology\u00a0which includes battery powered\/wireless up-lighting fixtures, intelligent lighting, atmospheric\u00a0lighting and effects, and other special items like our &#8220;Cold Sparks&#8221;.JAMMIN&#8217; DJs offers Up-lighting, Custom Gobos\/Monograms, Pin Spotting, Ceiling Washes, Texture Lighting, Architecture Lighting, Bistro Lighting, Lighted Columns, H2O effects, Themed weddings, and other atmospheric lighting and effects.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Here is an article from the knot magazine about up-lighting:<\/h4>\r\n<p><i>&#8220;Wedding reception lighting is one of the simplest (and cheapest) ways to completely transform your reception venue. Think about it: You most likely can&#8217;t repaint bland walls or a ceiling, but by washing the room in colored lighting or an eye-catching projection, you can instantly take the space from so-so to stunning. Assess your wedding location. Try to visit at least once at night so you can see how much lighting you will need. Finally, it is time to decide what kind of wedding lighting you want. A color wash (which blankets an area in a certain color of light), gobos (which are stencils put over lights to project certain patterns or designs, such as your monogram), and LED lights (which use less electricity than regular incandescent bulbs and are great for accent lighting). Your wedding lighting professional will be able to help you determine your specific wedding decor needs.&#8221; ~ The Knot<\/i><\/p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<a\r\n\t\t\thref=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/TRUSST-Scrim-5e8296b5d2c39-1024x975.jpg\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-fancybox=\"images\" \r\n\t\t\ttitle=\"TRUSST-Scrim-5e8296b5d2c39\" \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-description=\"\" \r\n\t\t\titemprop=\"contentUrl\">\r\n\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/TRUSST-Scrim-5e8296b5d2c39-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-no-lazy=\"1\" itemprop=\"thumbnail\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" \/>\r\n\t\t\t<!-- Overlay Wrapper -->\r\n\t\t\t <!-- Overlay Wrapper Closed -->\r\n\t\t\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<meta itemprop=\"width\" content=\"300\" \/>\r\n\t\t\t<meta itemprop=\"height\" content=\"300\" \/>\r\n\t\t\t\t<a\r\n\t\t\thref=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/SSPX0147-5e8296b081519-1024x768.jpg\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-fancybox=\"images\" \r\n\t\t\ttitle=\"SSPX0147-5e8296b081519\" \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-description=\"\" \r\n\t\t\titemprop=\"contentUrl\">\r\n\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/SSPX0147-5e8296b081519-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-no-lazy=\"1\" itemprop=\"thumbnail\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" \/>\r\n\t\t\t<!-- Overlay Wrapper -->\r\n\t\t\t <!-- Overlay Wrapper Closed -->\r\n\t\t\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<meta itemprop=\"width\" content=\"300\" \/>\r\n\t\t\t<meta itemprop=\"height\" content=\"300\" \/>\r\n\t\t\t\t<a\r\n\t\t\thref=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/P8050050-5e8296a9b5c9d-1024x768.jpg\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\